            "language": "cpp",
            "code": "#include <format>\n#include <print>   // C++23\n\nint count = 42;\ndouble rate = 0.9876;\n\nstd::string s = std::format(\"{} itens, {:.2%} sucesso\", count, rate);\nstd::println(\"{} itens, {:.2%} sucesso\", count, rate);   // C++23"
